{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The end is approaching, and the primary task is to escape with your daughter</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Reasonably plan resources: food, beverages, water, cooking ingredients Ensure that you and your daughter are in good physical condition.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/a52d2507d58b0a807425c7260bece5b2.avif?t=1738864401\" width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Having a variety of weapons to choose from: melee weapons, pistols, shotguns, assault rifles And it can be customized and upgraded at the engineer's office.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/f5c727627cb6025f2d3a02fb0b75aae9.avif?t=1738864401\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/933a50c44611fcdc4f82130112a98a00.avif?t=1738864401\" data-has-big width=800 height=554 /></span>*Faced with an endless stream of corpses, the level design will provide heavy firepower to help resist<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/ff1e7bff8fb333f745ed831600a9f994.avif?t=1738864401\" data-has-big width=800 height=627 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/ba540d9229674d5be177135ee7e6ce5c.avif?t=1738864401\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>*Don't worry, the game will be adapted to English and currently provides Chinese screenshots.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search buildings and discover survivors. You can choose whether to accept them as teammates, which will affect the subsequent game story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/3d772ca1cb52edacdf40e4ec31567819.avif?t=1738864401\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>*Don't worry, the game will be adapted to English and currently provides Chinese screenshots.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Search every building as you like! Be careful, the interior of the building is full of unknowns, NPCs in need of help, enemies with bad intentions, etc......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find supplies in the building, set up a workshop, create items, cook food, lie in bed, and more......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shelters can provide rest, crafting items, dodging the tide of corpses, etc....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/cdf341b3ac8e0446c1a30a808ab16a47.avif?t=1738864401\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>*Don't worry, the game will be adapted to English and currently provides Chinese screenshots.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Plan to create a trilogy consisting of three stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Plan the game duration to be 8 hours+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Communication group: 733742575\u00a0 (Tencent QQ Group).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3321680?t=1738864401","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738864401","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/35ec4f50a115bce9524831